---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy - Cheflink"
  description="Privacy Policy for Cheflink, the QR ordering and table tab management platform."
  canonicalPath="/en/privacy/"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-12">
    <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
      <header class="mb-6 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4">
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Last updated: January 2025</p>
        <p class="mt-2 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-amber-800">
          This text is provided for informational purposes and does not constitute legal advice. We recommend reviewing it with your legal counsel and adapting it to the regulations of your country before using it in production.
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">At <strong>Cheflink</strong> we value the privacy of restaurants, bars, cafés, and the Guests who use our Platform. This Privacy Policy explains what personal data we collect, how we use it, with whom we share it, and what rights Users have over their information.</p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">By using Cheflink, you accept the practices described in this Policy. If you disagree, we recommend not using the Platform.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">2. Data Controller</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">The entity responsible for processing personal data within the Cheflink Platform is:</p>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-none space-y-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>Trade name:</strong> Cheflink</li>
          <li><strong>Contact email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hola@cheflink.com" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">hola@cheflink.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Country / jurisdiction:</strong> <em>[indicate country]</em></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Depending on the relationship, Venues (restaurants, bars, etc.) may also act as independent or joint data controllers with respect to their Guests' data.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">3. Data We Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">The types of personal data we may collect through Cheflink include:</p>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">3.1. Venue data (professional users)</h3>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>Business name, legal name, and basic tax information.</li>
          <li>Name and contact details of the main contact person (email, phone, etc.).</li>
          <li>Venue configuration data (language, currency, menus, tables, service charge settings, etc.).</li>
          <li>Account credentials (email, username, encrypted passwords).</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">3.2. Guest data</h3>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>Order information (selected items, special notes, assigned table, order timestamps).</li>
          <li>Contact details only when voluntarily provided by the Guest (e.g., name, email, or phone for invoicing or loyalty purposes).</li>
          <li>Basic technical information (IP address, device/browser type, date and time of access).</li>
        </ul>
        <h3 class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">3.3. Usage and analytics data</h3>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>Pages visited within the Platform and actions taken.</li>
          <li>Aggregated and statistical information about order volume, service times, and general Platform usage.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">4. How We Use Data</h2>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>To provide and operate the Cheflink Platform.</li>
          <li>To allow Venues to manage their business.</li>
          <li>To communicate with the Venue about technical issues, updates, and changes to the Terms.</li>
          <li>To respond to support requests.</li>
          <li>To improve the Platform and develop new features.</li>
          <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">5. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>Contract performance:</strong> when processing is necessary to provide the Cheflink service to the Venue.</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> to improve the Platform, prevent fraud, and ensure security.</li>
          <li><strong>Consent:</strong> when the Guest voluntarily provides their data for specific purposes.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal compliance:</strong> when regulations require retaining certain information.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">6. Who We Share Data With</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">We do not sell personal data. We may share information in the following cases:</p>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>With the Venue:</strong> order data is shared with the Venue to manage service.</li>
          <li><strong>Service providers:</strong> third parties who help us host the Platform and perform usage analysis.</li>
          <li><strong>Authorities:</strong> when required by law.</li>
          <li><strong>Corporate transactions:</strong> in the event of a merger or acquisition.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">7. Data Retention</h2>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>Venue account data is retained while the Venue maintains an active relationship with Cheflink.</li>
          <li>Order data may be retained for auditing and billing purposes, subject to applicable legal retention periods.</li>
          <li>Guest contact data for commercial purposes will be retained while consent exists and deletion has not been requested.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">8. Your Rights</h2>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>Access:</strong> know what data we process and obtain a copy.</li>
          <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
          <li><strong>Erasure:</strong> request deletion of data when no longer necessary.</li>
          <li><strong>Restriction:</strong> request that we limit processing in certain cases.</li>
          <li><strong>Objection:</strong> object to processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
          <li><strong>Portability:</strong> receive data in a structured, machine-readable format where applicable.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:hola@cheflink.com" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">hola@cheflink.com</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">9. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li>To maintain the logged-in session for the Venue or authorized staff.</li>
          <li>To remember certain configuration preferences.</li>
          <li>To obtain aggregated statistics about Platform usage.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">10. Data Security</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect personal data, including encrypted connections (HTTPS) and encrypted password storage.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">11. International Data Transfers</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Where necessary, we will adopt measures to ensure an adequate level of protection, such as standard contractual clauses or other recognized mechanisms.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">12. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">When we make significant changes, we will endeavor to notify the Venue through reasonable channels. The current version will always be the one published on this page.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-6 space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">13. Contact</h2>
        <ul class="mt-1 list-none space-y-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hola@cheflink.com" class="text-orange-600 hover:underline">hola@cheflink.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Suggested subject:</strong> "Cheflink Privacy Policy Inquiry"</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <p class="mt-8 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 text-center text-xs text-slate-500">
        This text is a reference example. Adjust, translate, or expand it to meet the legal and regulatory requirements of your business.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</LegalLayout>
